  "notes": {
    "dynamicColor": "关闭。Material You 会按设备壁纸取色，导致同一款 App 在不同设备/平台上颜色不同，与跨平台一致的目标冲突。",
    "platformMapping": "iOS 用 SwiftUI 语义色映射 M3 角色；HarmonyOS 用 ArkUI 资源色映射同一套角色。三者共用本文件的数值。",
    "sizing": "Control roles use the size tokens as their only dimensions: buttons 40dp, fields and search 56dp, chips 32dp, list rows 56dp, top bar 64dp, icon targets 48dp. Buttons use the 12dp medium shape, cards 16dp, fields 12dp. Typography comes from the named Material 3 roles. Layout spacing uses the 4/8/12/16/24/32dp scale."
